&lt;h3 id="the-points-i-thought-nice"&gt;The points I thought nice&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;I can erase many times and use endlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;I can erase using wet tissue: the item is in office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It is easy to convert to a digital format.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="how-to-buy"&gt;How to buy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I bought one on the US Amazon because they are not sold in normal Japanese e-commerce sites.
You can buy in the same way as Japanese Amazon if you don&amp;rsquo;t mind waiting shipping lag and reading English.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Tatsuta Jam</title><link>https://odekake.zzzmisa.com/tatsuta-jam/</link><pubDate>Sat, 17 Jun 2017 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://odekake.zzzmisa.com/tatsuta-jam/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;I visited Tatsuta Jam which was selected as the top five in the world&amp;rsquo;s Dalemain Marmalade Awards 2016. It is a lovely shop that has a cat design signboard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unfortunately, the &amp;ldquo;yuzu marmalade&amp;rdquo; which won the prize are sold out in this season, so I bought an amanatsu marmalade jam. These jams are perfect for gifts because of it&amp;rsquo;s cute packaging and long shelf life.&lt;/p&gt;
